# Known Issues & Operational Notes

==================================================
## Disk Full / VS Code Remote-SSH Failures

### Symptoms
- SSH connection drops or is refused
- VS Code Remote-SSH fails with:
  - `Failed to parse remote port from server output`
  - `Permission denied (publickey,password)` (sometimes secondary)
- Pi becomes unresponsive or unstable

### Root Cause
Root filesystem fills to 100%. When free space hits zero, VS Code cannot install/start its server and other processes begin to fail.

Primary space consumers observed:
- `~/.ros/log` — grows without bound (ROS does not auto-prune logs)
- `~/.arduino15` — Arduino IDE package and staging cache

### Immediate Fix
```bash
# Clear ROS logs (safe)
rm -rf ~/.ros/log/*

# Clear Arduino staging cache (safe – will re-download if needed)
rm -rf ~/.arduino15/staging/*

# Verify free space
df -h /

